    },
    {
      "content" : [
        {
          "anchor" : "overview",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Overview",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Design objects are the main entities of the design. Each object can have",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "multiple versions and each version is called an ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "inlineContent" : [
                {
                  "text" : "object snapshot",
                  "type" : "text"
                }
              ],
              "type" : "emphasis"
            },
            {
              "text" : ". In the",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "design process the object might exist in different states, based on its",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "mutability and validity. The ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/ObjectProtocol",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " protocol provides unified",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "interface for all of those state representations.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "The different representations that the object might be in are:",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "items" : [
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/ObjectSnapshot",
                      "isActive" : true,
                      "type" : "reference"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : ": Object that has been validated and can not be modified.",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : " ",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : "They are the items of a",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/DesignPlane",
                      "isActive" : true,
                      "type" : "reference"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : " and can be shared by multiple planes.",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "content" : [
                {
                  "inlineContent" : [
                    {
                      "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/TransientObject",
                      "isActive" : true,
                      "type" : "reference"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : ": Object of a temporary nature, that can be modified. The",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : " ",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : "Mutable object is then turned into a ",
                      "type" : "text"
                    },
                    {
                      "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/ObjectSnapshot",
                      "isActive" : true,
                      "type" : "reference"
                    },
                    {
                      "text" : " when valid.",
                      "type" : "text"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type" : "paragraph"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type" : "unorderedList"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Each object object has a unique identity, collection of attributes",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "and might have topological relationships. Identity serves as a handle of an",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : "object. Attributes define a state of an object.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "anchor" : "Attributes-and-Object-to-Object-References",
          "level" : 2,
          "text" : "Attributes and Object-to-Object References",
          "type" : "heading"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "All object-to-object references are explicitly managed through either",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/ObjectProtocol\/topology",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : " or parent\/child relationships. Object attributes can hold any",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "identifier" : "doc:\/\/PoieticCore\/documentation\/PoieticCore\/Variant",
              "isActive" : true,
              "type" : "reference"
            },
            {
              "text" : ", they can not formally store references to other objects.",
              "type" : "text"
            }
          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "kind" : "content"
    }
  ],
